OL,3,ATwo Reform officials step down after
OL,4,Aundercover donations report
OL,5,
OL,6,FReform UK says two senior officials
OL,7,Fhave stepped down as the party launched
OL,8,Fan investigation into claims about
OL,9,Ffunding aired during a Channel 4 News
OL,10,Freport.
OL,12,FNigel Farage's senior aide Dan Jukes
OL,13,Fand Reform's head of policy James Orr
OL,14,Fhave both stood down pending the
OL,15,Foutcome of the internal probe, the
OL,16,Fparty said.
OL,18,FThe party added the investigation
OL,19,Fshould be "allowed to proceed
OL,20,Findependently and without prejudice"
OL,21,Fand it would make no further comment
OL,22,Ffor now.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
