OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AArgentine leader threatens to sanction
OL,4,Aoil firms and reiterates Falklands
OL,5,Aclaim
OL,6,
OL,7,FMilei said the Sea Lion oilfield, where
OL,8,Fa British and an Israeli firm are due
OL,9,Fto begin exploration work, was a "clear
OL,10,Fand present danger".
OL,12,FIn a statement on Friday, Downing
OL,13,FStreet said it was "clear that the
OL,14,FFalkland Islanders' right of
OL,15,Fself-determination extends to the right
OL,16,Fto exploit their own natural
OL,17,Fresources".
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
