OL,3,ATensions flare as judge declines to
OL,4,Aremove juror in Lindsay Clancy trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has again told the deadlocked
OL,7,Fjury in Lindsay Clancy's murder trial
OL,8,Fto keep trying to reach a verdict after
OL,9,Fa dramatic sixth day of deliberations
OL,10,Fin a case that has gripped America.
OL,12,FTensions flared in court after the jury
OL,13,Fforewoman sent the judge a note saying
OL,14,Fone juror would not follow the judge's
OL,15,Finstructions on reasonable doubt.
OL,17,FThere was audible shock in the room
OL,18,Fwhen the defence team asked for the
OL,19,Fjuror to be removed, a request that was
OL,20,Fdenied by the judge.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
