OL,3,ATensions flare as judge declines to
OL,4,Aremove juror in Lindsay Clancy trial
OL,5,
OL,6,FClancy, 36, is charged with three
OL,7,Fcounts of first-degree murder in the
OL,8,Fdeaths of her three children - Cora,
OL,9,Ffive, Dawson, three, and
OL,10,Feight-month-old Callan - at her
OL,11,FMassachusetts family home on 24 January
OL,12,F2023.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
